# data/map-images/ and data/hero-renders/ are TRACKED as of v2.1.0 — the
# shipped image packs are committed and bundled into packaged builds
# (electron-builder extraResources -> seeded into userData on first launch),
# because packaged installs had empty user-data dirs and fell back to face
# icons / blank map cards. Producer drop-ins still win at runtime; drop-in
# files that aren't committed simply show up as untracked.
